      ['A huge hornbill with a solid, ivory-like casque on its bill, which it uses in mid-air head-butting contests. Its loud, hooting call ends in maniacal laughter. Poaching for its casque, carved as “hornbill ivory” and smuggled to China, made it critically endangered.'],
