      ['A long-legged ground cuckoo that runs at up to about 30 km/h and kills rattlesnakes, lizards and scorpions, bashing them on rocks. On cold mornings it warms up by exposing a patch of black skin on its back to the sun. It is far less of a clown than its cartoon namesake.'],
